<BaseLayout title="CV — M. Berkan Taştan"><section class="shell py-20"><div class="flex flex-col gap-6 lg:flex-row lg:items-end lg:justify-between"><div><p class="kicker mb-4">Curriculum Vitae</p><h1 class="text-4xl font-black sm:text-6xl">M. Berkan Taştan</h1><p class="mt-4 text-lg text-slate-400">Lead R&D Engineer · System Test & Validation · Simulation & Systems Integration</p><p class="mt-2 text-sm text-slate-500">Istanbul, Türkiye · <a class="text-cyan-300" href="mailto:mberkantastan@gmail.com">mberkantastan@gmail.com</a> · <a class="text-cyan-300" href="tel:+905516385581">+90 551 638 5581</a></p></div><div class="flex flex-wrap gap-2"><a href="/cv/Mustafa_Berkan_Tastan_CV_TR.pdf" target="_blank" class="rounded-full bg-cyan-300 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold text-slate-950">View PDF ↗</a><a href="/cv/Mustafa_Berkan_Tastan_CV_TR.pdf" download class="rounded-full border border-white/10 px-5 py-3 text-sm font-bold">Download PDF</a></div></div>
<div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_.8fr]"><div><section><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Professional Summary</h2><p class="mt-4 leading-8 text-slate-400">I graduated from Istanbul Technical University in Marine Engineering. I have experience in R&D, system simulation, mathematical modelling, test and validation, field operations and technical project management. In my current role at GDS Engineering R&D, I lead engineering simulation and software-development activities and coordinate test infrastructure field operations and technical reporting.</p></section>
<section class="cv-section"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Experience</h2><div class="cv-item"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">GDS Engineering R&D</h3><p class="text-cyan-300">Lead R&D Engineer & Technical Operations Manager</p></div><span class="mono text-xs text-slate-500">2025 — Present</span></div><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-7 text-slate-400"><li>Manage field operations, test procedures and technical reporting for engineering test activities.</li><li>Develop mathematical models and simulation software for more than ten engineering modules on a LabVIEW-based ship engine room simulation platform.</li><li>Contribute to system behaviour modelling and integration with technical user interfaces.</li><li>Managed the development of more than twenty user interfaces.</li><li>Coordinate installation, commissioning, integration, acceptance and user/instructor training processes.</li><li>Coordinate technical operations, R&D activities and cross-disciplinary delivery processes.</li></ul></div>
<div class="cv-item"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Master Makina ve Denizcilik Sanayi</h3><p class="text-cyan-300">Service Engineer</p></div><span class="mono text-xs text-slate-500">2023 — 2025</span></div><ul class="mt-4 list-disc space-y-2 pl-5 leading-7 text-slate-400"><li>Performed service, maintenance and field engineering on turbochargers, steering systems, main-engine control systems, fuel pumps and hydraulic/pneumatic systems.</li><li>Worked on troubleshooting, maintenance, commissioning and technical checks of mechanical and control systems.</li><li>Participated in crane inspection operations and electronic-system revisions.</li><li>Coordinated technical workshop and field operations.</li></ul></div>
<div class="cv-item"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Harren Group</h3><p class="text-cyan-300">Engine Cadet</p></div><span class="mono text-xs text-slate-500">2022 · 6 months</span></div><p class="mt-4 leading-7 text-slate-400">Completed sea training aboard the chemical tanker PATANI, gaining practical experience in engine-room operations, maintenance and machinery systems.</p></div>
<div class="cv-item"><div class="flex flex-wrap items-baseline justify-between gap-3"><div><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Master Makina ve Denizcilik Sanayi</h3><p class="text-cyan-300">Engineering Intern</p></div><span class="mono text-xs text-slate-500">2021</span></div></div></section>
<section class="cv-section"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Education</h2><div class="mt-4"><h3 class="text-xl font-bold">Istanbul Technical University</h3><p class="text-cyan-300">Marine Engineering · 2018–2023</p><p class="mt-1 text-slate-500">GPA: 2.99 / 4.00</p></div></section>
<section class="cv-section"><h2 class="text-2xl font-bold">Training</h2><p class="mt-4 text-slate-400"><strong class="text-white">Electronically Controlled Main Engines Training</strong> — DS Crewing GmbH, July 2026</p></section></div>
